==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|High Speed}}

==Battleground==
*12 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 56.67~60 seconds<sup>1,700f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Bore Jr.]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Nimoy Bore]]s spawn, delay 60~63.33 seconds<sup>1,800f~1,900f</sup>.
**8 [[Star Peng]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 63.33~66.67 seconds<sup>1,900f~2,000f</sup>.
**5 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**6 [[Bore Jr.|Bore Jrs]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
**1 [[Professor A.]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

